    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d247">

                <pb facs="0378" n="308" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg308"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Dayton.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No 95.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi><hi
                                rendition="#italic"> Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1861-12-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 28, 1861. SIR: * * * * * * *
                    *</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>You have rightly conjectured that the subject of our relations with Great
                    Britain, as affected by recent events, at present engages the chief attention of
                    the government, so far as foreign affairs are concerned.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">William L. Dayton</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
